  "reasoning": "The claim was denied for CO-197 (missing prior authorization), and the payer explicitly does not offer a retroactive authorization window, making request_retro_auth impossible. Resubmitting the claim as-is (submit_clean) is prohibited by the duplicate claim rule (CO-18) since it has already been adjudicated. Given the high medical necessity of the procedure (CPT 93229 for I47.1/I48.0) and the lack of other procedural remedies like peer-to-peer, filing a formal appeal with a medical-necessity argument is the only available action to attempt to overturn the denial.",
